---
title: KaleidoSpark launches kaleidosparkhq.com
summary: New marketing home for services, insights, and products—separate from the KaleidoSpark portal.
publishedAt: 2026-09-01
---

KaleidoSpark today launched its public site at kaleidosparkhq.com, consolidating services, industries, insights, and product information under a single UK domain.

The KaleidoSpark portal remains available for product access at app.kaleidosparkhq.com.
